{
  "name": "dsh-agent-echo",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "回声面板（dsh-agent-echo）—— agent 记忆中枢的实时体检台：把「压缩 / 门牌 / 索引 / 自我层 / 心跳 / 账本 / 热记忆 / 版本漂移」这些状态摆在一个页面上。体检逻辑在 echo-doctor.mjs（命令行与面板共用同一份），本插件只做两件事：起一个只读路由、画一张表。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "files": [
    "README.md",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "echo-config.mjs",
    "echo-doctor.mjs",
    "echo.config.example.json",
    "index.js",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "dsh-agent-organs contributors"
}
